WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.299
 I'm Coach Tab Baldwin, head coach of the Ateneo Blue Eagles.

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:12.500
 I'm here this morning to speak to the families of my two basketball players, Devina Deely

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.059
 and Renee Barabonia.

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:25.070
 I've been asked to limit my comments this morning to four minutes.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:30.589
 In a situation in which I've been utterly lost for words, four minutes seems like an

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:42.109
 eternity and yet if I had the opportunity to speak about Renee and Devina, I believe I

00:00:42.109 --> 00:00:54.250
 could speak for hours, but they are gone and we are left behind.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:01:04.409
 In being left behind we are carrying immense sorrow, we're carrying immense grief, we're

00:01:04.409 --> 00:01:16.569
 carrying immense remorse, but I've known since the moment that I was told that our boys had

00:01:16.569 --> 00:01:28.219
 passed away that no matter the magnitude of our grief, there were two families that experienced

00:01:28.219 --> 00:01:38.120
 a loss that was so much greater than ours and a loss that would stay with them in the

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:43.959
 most acute way for the remainder of their lives.

00:01:43.959 --> 00:01:52.719
 Never again would Renee's mother and father and family never again would divine's family

00:01:52.719 --> 00:02:03.780
 be able to talk to their son or touch their son.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:11.139
 I guess as a coach I lost my boys too.

00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:20.539
 Never again would I be able to help them develop into the basketball player they wanted to be

00:02:20.539 --> 00:02:32.069
 to help them grow into the young man that they promised that they could be, but that's

00:02:32.069 --> 00:02:41.199
 insignificant compared to what your families are experiencing.

00:02:41.199 --> 00:02:53.379
 As a coach we are entrusted with the growth of our basketball players, the development

00:02:53.379 --> 00:03:05.479
 of these young men into future professionals, but mostly as a coach I'm entrusted by

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:16.250
 you the parents and the families with first and foremost their well-being and in this I feel

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:38.699
 I failed and I'm sorry to the depth of my being I'm sorry on that fateful day when we sent

00:03:38.699 --> 00:03:48.500
 the players out for a routine training run and what we thought was shallow water up

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:53.740
 to the moment when we realized that whatever had happened they were in

00:03:53.740 --> 00:04:03.419
 dangerous water and we did everything that we could as coaches as people

00:04:03.419 --> 00:04:08.219
 responsible for that situation the players themselves did everything they

00:04:08.219 --> 00:04:16.740
 could to ensure that everybody arrived back on shore safely and then we

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:30.899
 realized that we hadn't accomplished that and in that moment I experienced the

00:04:30.899 --> 00:04:44.800
 descent into the darkest place imaginable and yet I knew at the same time that

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.680
 good people people that had done an amazing job raising these two young men

00:04:49.959 --> 00:05:01.139
 were going to be in an even darker more horrible place at that moment I felt felt

00:05:01.139 --> 00:05:08.420
 I had failed I failed as a leader I felt I had failed as a coach I certainly felt

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:18.410
 like I had felt as a failed as a friend to divine and Renee and when later I

00:05:18.449 --> 00:05:28.699
 faced the team to try to be a leader in that moment I felt that I failed them too

00:05:28.699 --> 00:05:38.699
 and that left me with really the only thing that I've been clinging to for

00:05:38.699 --> 00:05:53.899
 the last several days that as as part of a community of faith to pray to pray that

00:05:53.939 --> 00:06:06.430
 the Lord embraces our two boys to pray that the Lord gives peace comfort some

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:18.529
 sense of sanity to the Barabona family and the Adili family and I continue to

00:06:18.529 --> 00:06:34.480
 beseech everybody that cared for loves love Renee and divine and their

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:48.350
 families please keep praying I think that my voice in prayer is horse now but it

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:57.360
 will never be enough so as we all try to move forward without divine and Renee I

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:08.129
 hope that in binding together as a community as a basketball team and as a

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:18.060
 nation that we lean on the one place that will never let us down that is our Lord

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:32.829
 so deeply sorry I'm so deeply sorry to not just the families but everybody that

00:07:32.829 --> 00:07:44.649
 feels let down somehow be trade and I pray that we all find some pathway

00:07:44.649 --> 00:07:57.110
 forward to come back to hope for the future love for one another and forgiveness

00:07:57.110 --> 00:08:05.870
 for the for those of us who failed and tried so desperately hard to reach a

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:16.980
 better outcome I wish peace for everybody I wish comfort for everybody who is

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:35.169
 hurting and I pray that we will all find that God bless you all and we are

00:08:35.169 --> 00:08:39.649
 trying thank you

